cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "spatchcocking"
abstract: >-
  A Python package for 3D-to-2D morphometric mapping of curved biological tubes.
  Implements the spatchcocking projection used to standardize and compare
  local tissue properties (curvature, thickness, mitotic activity) across
  3D surfaces of the cranial neural tube.
